<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S0.F1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 1</span>: </span><span id="S0.F1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Left: Lynx consistently preserves facial identity with high fidelity, while producing natural motion, coherent lighting, and flexible scene adaptation (input shown at top-left). Right: Lynx demonstrates clear superiority in identity resemblance and perceptual quality, while remaining competitive in motion naturalness compared to other methods.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
